<SimplePage
  title="Community Involvement - Gene Johnson"
  description="Gene Johnson supports the greater Seattle community through local giving programs, including our Warm Hearts initiative for households in need."
  path="/about-us/community/"
  eyebrow="Community"
  tagline="Nearly fifty years in the Puget Sound area means giving back isn't optional - it's part of how we operate."
  icon="Family Owned"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "About Us", href: "/about-us/" }, { name: "Community" }]}
>
  <p>
    Being a family-owned business in the same community for decades means our customers are also our neighbors. We support local causes throughout the year, from sponsoring youth sports teams to partnering with local trade schools on apprenticeship pipelines.
  </p>

  <h2>Warm Hearts</h2>
  <p>
    Our <a href="/about-us/community/warm-hearts/">Warm Hearts program</a> provides free furnace and water heater repairs or replacements to households facing hardship who otherwise couldn't afford them - because no family should have to go without heat or hot water over a repair bill.
  </p>

  <h2>Supporting the trades</h2>
  <p>
    We work with regional trade schools and apprenticeship programs to help the next generation of plumbers, HVAC technicians, and electricians get a foothold in the industry - the same way many of our own senior technicians got their start.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
